# Manual API requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
# Start the backend first:  .venv/bin/uvicorn app.main:app --reload
# Then click "Send Request" above any request. Requests are separated by ###.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@email = asha@campus.edu
@password = password123

### Health check (also returns server time)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register a user (409 if the email already exists - then just log in)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "display_name": "Asha"
}

### Log in. The "@name login" tag lets later requests reuse this response.
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Who am I? Uses the token from the login request above (send login first).
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### No token -> expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/me

### Wrong password -> expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "not-the-password"
}

### Create a listing (login first). Needs a real image file: change ./photo.png to any
### JPEG/PNG/WebP on your machine. {{$datetime iso8601 2 h}} = two hours from now.
# @name createListing
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CampusBid

--CampusBid
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Hero cycle
--CampusBid
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

cycle
--CampusBid
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="condition"

good
--CampusBid
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="starting_price"

500
--CampusBid
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="min_increment"

50
--CampusBid
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="closes_at"

{{$datetime iso8601 2 h}}
--CampusBid
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="photo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./photo.png
--CampusBid--

### View that listing (public, no token needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{createListing.response.body.id}}

### Browse: all open auctions, ending soonest first (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings

### Browse with search + filters + sorting. Every word in q must appear in title/description.
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?q=cycle&category=cycle&condition=good&max_price=2000&sort=price_low

### Only auctions closing within the hour
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?closing_soon=true

### Pagination: second page of 10
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?limit=10&offset=10

### Other states, e.g. unsold or cancelled listings
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?status=unsold
